        <mxCell id="c3-note" value="bed is the WEAK entity: double border, identified by its ward through the DOUBLE DIAMOND, with bed_no as a partial key — &quot;GM-04&quot; means nothing until you say which ward. occupies carries from_at and to_at, which is why it becomes admission + bed_occupancy rather than a bed_id on the stay: a patient who moves from the general ward to the ICU must not lose where they were yesterday." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=24;fontColor=#47606D;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D3DEE3;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="260" y="1465" width="1500" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
