        <mxCell id="c5-note" value="All three diamonds carry attributes and all three become tables. refers is RECURSIVE: two lines to hospital, labelled from and to — which is what makes the system national. reads is TERNARY: an account reads a patient, sometimes through one encounter, and always under a stated basis. That basis column is what separates care from snooping." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=24;fontColor=#47606D;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D3DEE3;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="1660" width="1500" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
